%H A401405 Zhicheng Wei, <a href="/A401405/b401405.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..29</a>
%e A401405 210 is in this sequence because 210 is in A025487, and the next number in A025487 is 216, where 210/216 = 35/36, and there is no number k below 210 in A025487 where k / (next number in A025487 above k) is larger than or equal to 35/36.
